{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211490/extras/785df27a83041b04b7eab305d9516929.poster.avif?t=1768985654\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211490/extras/785df27a83041b04b7eab305d9516929.webm?t=1768985654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211490/extras/785df27a83041b04b7eab305d9516929.mp4?t=1768985654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story </h2>A girl awakens in a cold, damp morgue. Bloodstains, not yet dry, cling to the walls and floor, alongside unidentifiable chunks of flesh...<br><br>Grotesque moans from inhuman entities echo through the air.<br>In this research facility, warped by malice and roamed by otherworldly beings, you can run, hide, or use tools to try and escape...but a single mistake, and the girl\u2019s body will be torn apart and reduced to a mangled heap...<br><br><strong>Follow the trail drawn in blood and step into the source of this nightmarish aberration.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2>A controversial masterpiece banned in Japan for its shockingly intense content.<br>Seventeen years after the shocking legacy of the cult survival horror <strong>DEMONOPHOBIA</strong>...<br>A new wave of madness and despair rises once more.<br><br><i><strong>The Ultimate Horror Experience</strong></i><br>Expertly crafted nerve-shattering tension that slowly erodes at your sanity.<br>The sound of tearing flesh, the crunch of breaking bones, the sensation of entrails slamming against the floor\u2026<br>Vivid images of brutal death will sear themselves into your mind.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211490/extras/c12db0c84a510ca8acb672b0809e951c.poster.avif?t=1768985654\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211490/extras/c12db0c84a510ca8acb672b0809e951c.webm?t=1768985654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211490/extras/c12db0c84a510ca8acb672b0809e951c.mp4?t=1768985654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i><strong>Extreme Survival Exploration</strong></i><br>Monsters capable of reducing your body to mere scraps in an instant hunt you down relentlessly.<br>Use your wits and environmental traps to create fleeting moments of opportunity.<br>Blind them with flares, crawl through vents, or drag yourself across blood-soaked corridors to survive.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211490/extras/1f1172e8962903b0932a25ecabc9cb8b.poster.avif?t=1768985654\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211490/extras/1f1172e8962903b0932a25ecabc9cb8b.webm?t=1768985654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211490/extras/1f1172e8962903b0932a25ecabc9cb8b.mp4?t=1768985654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i><strong>A Nightmare Woven by the Player</strong></i><br>The truth of your existence and your surroundings are revealed in fragmented pieces, as if unraveling a forbidden taboo. When you connect all the clues, you may come to regret uncovering the full reality.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211490/extras/f6c196dc1e0d7504e236201b80baf2d4.poster.avif?t=1768985654\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211490/extras/f6c196dc1e0d7504e236201b80baf2d4.webm?t=1768985654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211490/extras/f6c196dc1e0d7504e236201b80baf2d4.mp4?t=1768985654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i><strong>Madness-Fueled Puzzles</strong></i><br>Endure unbearable terror that gnaws at your psyche.<br>Stay composed and deduce the answers with a clear mind.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211490/extras/bc308542d97dd0c131eaf47ec2b5bae6.poster.avif?t=1768985654\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211490/extras/bc308542d97dd0c131eaf47ec2b5bae6.webm?t=1768985654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211490/extras/bc308542d97dd0c131eaf47ec2b5bae6.mp4?t=1768985654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A forbidden survival horror game initially banned from sale and removed from its initial platform.</li><li>Two unlockable costumes that become available as you progress through the game.</li><li>A blood-soaked, despair-filled horror experience unlike any other.</li><li>Gallery mode for closely observing unlocked monsters.</li><li>Three difficulty settings: from Assisted, for focusing on story and puzzles, to Fragile, where unfair deaths await.</li></ul><br>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Cold Room","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3211490/bbbe6d8645b2b2143341ba43ece8b20db2bb8fe0.jpg"},{"name":"Silence","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3211490/37d50d8b90bf7b46f521d6b70aab78db6d6e9e6a.jpg"},{"name":"Refined Substance","path"