neral mature content is present."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Content Warning</h1><p>This game contains depictions of intense violence, horror, and trauma, as well as content that makes references to these themes.<br>Those sensitive to such material or those who experience physical or mental discomfort from it are advised to avoid prolonged play.<br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211490/extras/785df27a83041b04b7eab305d9516929.poster.avif?t=1768985654\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211490/extras/785df27a83041b04b7eab305d9516929.webm?t=1768985654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211490/extras/785df27a83041b04b7eab305d9516929.mp4?t=1768985654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story </h2>A girl awakens in a cold, damp morgue. Bloodstains, not yet dry, cling to the walls and floor, alongside unidentifiable chunks of flesh...<br><br>Grotesque moans from inhuman entities echo through the air.<br>In this research facility, warped by malice and roamed by otherworldly beings, you can run, hide, or use tools to try and escape...but a single mistake, and the girl\u2019s body will be torn apart and reduced to a mangled heap...<br><br><strong>Follow the trail drawn in blood and step into the source of this nightmarish aberration.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2>A controversial masterpiece banned in Japan for its shockingly intense content.<br>Seventeen years after the shocking legacy of the cult survival horror <strong>DEMONOPHOBIA</strong>...<br>A new wave of madness and despair rises once more.<br><br><i><strong>The Ultimate Horror Experience</strong></i><br>Expertly crafted nerve-shattering tension that slowly erodes at your sanity.<br>The sound of tearing flesh, the crunch of breaking bones, the sensation of entrails slamming against the floor\u2026<br>Vivid images of brutal death will sear themselves into your mind.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211490/extras/c12db0c84a510ca8acb672b0809e951c.poster.avif?t=1768985654\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211490/extras/c12db0c84a510ca8acb672b0809e951c.webm?t=1768985654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211490/extras/c12db0c84a510ca8acb672b0809e951c.mp4?t=1768985654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i><strong>Extreme Survival Exploration</strong></i><br>Monsters capable of reducing your body to mere scraps in an instant hunt you down relentlessly.<br>Use your wits and environmental traps to create fleeting moments of opportunity.<br>Blind them with flares, crawl through vents, or drag yourself across blood-soaked corridors to survive.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211490/extras/1f1172e8962903b0932a25ecabc9cb8b.poster.avif?t=1768985654\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211490/extras/1f1172e8962903b0932a25ecabc9cb8b.webm?t=1768985654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211490/extras/1f1172e8962903b0932a25ecabc9cb8b.mp4?t=1768985654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i><strong>A Nightmare Woven by the Player</strong></i><br>The truth of your existence and your surroundings are revealed in fragmented pieces, as if unraveling a forbidden taboo. When you connect all the clues, you may come to regret uncovering the full reality.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211490/extras/f6c196dc1e0d7504e236201b80baf2d4.poster.avif?t=1768985654\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211490/extras/f6c196dc1e0d7504e236201b80baf2d4.webm?t=1768985654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211490/extras/f6c196dc1e0d7504e236201b80baf2d4.mp4?t=1768985654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i><strong>Madness-Fueled Puzzles</strong></i><br>Endure unbearable terror that gnaws at your psyche.<br>Stay composed and deduce the answers with a clear mind.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211490/extras/bc308542d97dd0c131eaf47ec2b5bae6.poster.avif?t=1768985654\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211490/extras/bc308542d97dd0c131eaf47ec2b5bae6.webm?t=1768985654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211490/extras/bc308542d97dd0c131eaf47ec2b5bae6.mp4?t=1768985654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A forbidden survival horror game initially banned from sale and removed from its initial platform.</li><li>Two unlockable costumes that become available as you progress through the game.</li><li>A blood-soaked, despair-filled horror experience unlike any other.</li><li>Gallery mode for closely observing unlocked monsters.</li><li>Three difficulty settings: from Assisted, for focusing on story and puzzles, to Fragile, where unfair deaths await.</li></ul><br>","developers":["Madowaku Kobo"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211490/83a93eb72421a1a32d0457aa0483ba1df96f884f/header.jpg?t=1768985654","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3211490/1089082730/a6a1d8e795b29bc62f7b36915aa718123b58cc1a/1758611610/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762343941","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3211490/1089082730/a6a1d8e795b29bc62f7b36915aa718123b58cc1a/1758611610/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762343941","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3211490/1089082730/a6a1d8e795b29bc62f7b36915aa718123b58cc1a/1758611610/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762343941","id":257204471,"name":"DYSTHANASIA PV","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257204471/fc2da9cd79bc4abdd3afebe32697f6a507fb6ed9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762343941"}],"name":"DYSTHANASIA","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"DYSTHANASIA - $24.99 USD","packageid":1138608,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":2499}],"title":"Buy DYSTHANASIA"}],"packages":[1138608],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit pro